- **The graph's reference hash is NOT a constant** — ALWAYS read it from `{{ harness_understand_apps_root }}/.understand-anything/meta.json` (field `gitCommitHash`, the `LAST=` command above). A hash hardcoded in a doc desynchronizes on every incremental `/understand`.
